SUMMARY:GRA: An Absurd Existential Comedy
LOCATION:The Mab\, 435 Broadway\, San Francisco\, San Francisco
DESCRIPTION:GRA is a physical\, absurd\, poetic and tender exploration of 
 the strange business of being alive. A little worm tries to figure out ho
 w to be human\, while somewhere inside Carmen\, Gra emerges from the crac
 ks between who we are and who we are supposed to be. Moving through desir
 e\, shame\, pleasure\, love\, status and freedom\, the performance uses b
 ouffon clown\, mime\, physical theater and the language of the fool to se
 arch for a big\, creative\, funny\, poetic life.\n\nTickets / RSVP: https
 ://ma.to/event/gra-an-absurd-existential-comedy-10-nov-2026\n\nComedy + W
 eird & unusual · 2.4 mi from home
